       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Amlodipine 30 mg is three times the usual maximum daily dose of 10 mg, so it may be a typo.\n\n- **Usual dosing:** the range is 2.5\u201310 mg once daily. Most adults start at 5 mg, and 10 mg is the ceiling.\n- **Risks at 30 mg:** severe hypotension, reflex tachycardia, and peripheral edema. Overdose can also cause prolonged shock.\n\nWhich of these do you want?\n1. **Amlodipine 5 mg** by mouth once daily, the standard starting dose.\n2. **Amlodipine 10 mg** by mouth once daily, the maximum dose.\n3. **Another dose you meant.** Tell me the dose.\n4. **Amlodipine 30 mg as written.** If it's intentional, tell me the rationale and I'll enter it with a note documenting that."
      }
